:''Not to be confused with the [[Heavenly Tower]], [[Citadel]]s or [[Infernal Tower]].''
The '''Fascinating Fallen Tower''' (魅惑の堕天楼, ''Miwaku no Datenrō'', '''Fascinating Fallen Tower''') is an event added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], first appearing during the [[Anniversary/13 1/2 Year|13 1/2 Anniversary]]. It has no known schedule, and all rewards reset on every appearance. The Cat Units unlocked from [[Fascinating Fallen Tower/Floor 10|Floor 10]] and [[Fascinating Fallen Tower/Floor 20|Floor 20]] are only obtainable once from their respective floors.

Compared to the original Heavenly Tower, the Fascinating Fallen Tower has no checkpoints, but its rewards for Floors 10 and 20 are [[Cat Units]].
{{Map Stars|1023}}

==Overview==
The Fascinating Fallen Tower contains 30 stages, called '''Floors''' (階 ''Kai''), with a variety of enemies including [[:Category:Enemy Cats|Enemy Cats]] and [[:Category:Event Enemies|event enemies]]. After completing a floor for the first time, the player will receive gifts including [[Battle Items]], [[Catseye]]s, [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Gamatoto Expedition|Catamins]] and [[Leadership]]s along with [[Barista Cat (Special Cat)|Barista Cat]] and [[Commander Cat (Special Cat)|Commander Cat]] upon defeating [[Possessed Silver Nyanko Ranger|their respective]] [[Possessed Gold Nyanko Ranger|counterparts]] on the 10th and 20th and 50th floors respectively.

